<head>
    <style type="text/css">
        .auto-style1 {
            height: 23px;
        }

        .auto-style2 {
            width: 120px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<table cellspacing="0" style="border: 1px solid; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif; background-color: #E7F1F3">
    <tr height="70">
        <th style="background-color: #404C5A; color: #ffffff; text-transform: uppercase; padding-left: 10px; font-size: 20px; text-align: left; margin: auto;">
            复制注单作废 | Duplicate Ticket Voided
        </th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding: 0 0 10px 10px; border-bottom: 1 solid #CBCBCB;">
            <br />
            简体中文<br />
            <strong>亲爱的客户,</strong><br />
            请注意, 本公司发现您旗下会员有重单. 我们保留第 @(Model.TotalOrgTransIds) 张注单为有效, 然而已经将第二张注单作废. 请查看以下信息:<br />
            <strong>信息:</strong><br />
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.ChineseSimplified))
            {
                <span style="width: 1350px;">@Model.ChineseSimplified</span><br />
            }
            <strong style="color: red">以下是受影响的会员和注单.</strong><br />
            非常抱歉造成您的不便. 谢谢!<br />
            <br />
            English<br />
            <strong>Dear Valued Customer,</strong><br />
            Kindly to be informed duplicated tickets found for below match. Those affected tickets,
            we retained @(Model.TotalOrgTransIds) ticket as valid and had proceed to void the duplicate(s). Please
            refer to the below message:<br>
            <strong>Message:</strong><br />
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.English))
            {
                <span style="width: 1350px;">@Model.English</span><br />
            }
            <strong style="color: red">Kindly refer to below on the affected members & tickets.</strong><br />
            Sorry for the inconvenience caused, and thank you for your kind attention!
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #CBCBCB; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <td class="auto-style1"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding: 10px 0 0 10px;">
            <br />
            <table cellspacing="1" style="background-color: #CBCBCB; font-size: 12pt;">
                @foreach (var group in Model.DuplicateTickets)
                {
                    var backgroundColor = group.Id % 2 == 0 ? "#E4F2FD" : "#FFFFFF";
                    <tr valign="Middle" style="background-color: @backgroundColor; height: 25px;">
                        <td align="Center" style="padding: 10px;">
                            @group.Id
                        </td>
                        <td style="padding: 5px;">
                            <strong>System ID | 系统账号: @group.Usernames</strong><br />
                            Ref No: @group.OrgTransIds [REMAIN | 保留]<br />
                            Ref No: @group.VoidedTransIds [VOIDED | 作废]<br />
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                }
            </table>
            <br />
            <strong>Best Regards,</strong>
            <br /><br />
            <strong>@Model.DepartmentName</strong>
            <br /><br />
        </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="padding-left: 10px; background-color: #404C5A; color: #ffffff;" height="20">
            <em>此邮件为系统自动发出，请勿直接回复该邮件地址. 如需要進一步協助，請聯繫我方客服信箱: <span style="color: #19a2e8; text-decoration: underline">@Model.ContactAddress</span></em>
            <br />
            <em>This is system auto generated email, please do not reply to this email directly. For further communication, please contact us via the email address: <span style="color: #19a2e8; text-decoration: underline">@Model.ContactAddress</span></em>
            </td>
    </tr>
</table>